{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105210","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910521001:1":{"text":"I... I don't understand.","source_cn":"我……不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEF9E5FBFDE795ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910521002:1":{"text":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","source_cn":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB809841B2B8ED4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1910521002":{"text":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","source_cn":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB809841B2B8ED4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910521003:1":{"text":"I'm sorry, child. Even in our ballads, this kind of glowing tide has never been mentioned.","source_cn":"很抱歉，孩子。连我所知的歌谣里，从未提及过这种潮光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02E743458FAA21CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910521004:1":{"text":"We have gone beyond the usual range of the renewal season. The Tidewarden has never brought us to waters this deep.","source_cn":"此处已经超出了寻常洄游季下潜的范围，波涛长者从未带我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x030F357E3DA3C3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910521005:1":{"text":"I never knew that something so beautiful and so deadly existed in the depths of the Shimmering Sea...","source_cn":"我也不知道，流光海的深处，竟然还有如此美丽而致命的存在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4562F4E841C03B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"So that type of glowing tide can dissolve living things?!","source_cn":"那种潮光会溶解生物？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82CFE076CBAAD088","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So that type of glowing tide can dissolve living things?!","female":"So that type of glowing tide can dissolve living things?!","variant_male_record_index":"289613","variant_female_record_index":"289614","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910521006:1":{"text":"Because they couldn't beat us...?","source_cn":"因为……打不过咱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3150C87BABC788CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910521007:1":{"text":"That's not right... Even if they couldn't win, why would they walk into that? It was like... like they were being controlled.","source_cn":"不对……就算打不过，他们为什么又要主动走到潮光里？那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5B9C60ADFC4A4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910521008:1":{"text":"They all stopped, looked in the same direction, and walked silently into the glowing tide...","source_cn":"突然停下所有动作，看向同一个方向，默默地走进潮光中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CDC9ABE79108EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910521009:1":{"text":"可能……他们，想回家了。\n我也……想回家，好可怕……","source_cn":"可能……他们，想回家了。\\n我也……想回家，好可怕……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x60492DE90E734E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910521010:1":{"text":"Don't be scared, Shay. I swear, no matter what happens, I'll always protect you.","source_cn":"小汐儿，别害怕，姐姐发誓，无论发生什么，我都会保护你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32143B8DB69E4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910521011:1":{"text":"马上，马上我们就带你回家，好吗？","source_cn":"马上，马上我们就带你回家，好吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCF5B7105A1B437CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Why did the Deepfolk walk into the glowing tide willingly?","source_cn":"深海裔为何主动走入那片潮光？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2865ED80B65F96","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why did the Deepfolk walk into the glowing tide willingly?","female":"Why did the Deepfolk walk into the glowing tide willingly?","variant_male_record_index":"289615","variant_female_record_index":"289616","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910521012:4":{"text":"If you ask me, those Deepsea fish went mad a long time ago. Nothing they do would surprise me. Why bother trying to guess what's going on in their heads?","source_cn":"要咱说，那群深海鱼早就疯了，做出什么事都不奇怪，咱们费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373BEF195FEA670E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910521013:1":{"text":"As for that glowing tide... I've never seen anything like it, but my Mauler instincts tell me it's not good.","source_cn":"倒是那片发着光的水……咱没见过，但卡什澜人的直觉告诉咱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DCC0C5A17A042E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910521014:1":{"text":"Oh no! The glowing tide!","source_cn":"——不好……那片潮光！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04FE1AA017ECAD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910521015:1":{"text":"It's coming for Coralia!","source_cn":"它……朝着塔拉萨来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B996C96A0B248D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:2:3":{"text":"It's still a bit strange...","source_cn":"还是有些奇怪……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x19F7DA5593017513","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's still a bit strange...","female":"It's still a bit strange...","variant_male_record_index":"289617","variant_female_record_index":"289618","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"Elphira","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖母摩淖亚":{"text":"Grandma Menoa","source":"祖母摩淖亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:图澜":{"text":"Tolan","source":"图澜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小汐儿":{"text":"Shay","source":"小汐儿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沫霖":{"text":"Morin","source":"沫霖","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":5}}